# Alibaba Cloud pay-as-you-go key (Model Studio / DashScope, international region).
# MUST be a pay-as-you-go key (sk- or sk-ws-). Token Plan keys (sk-sp-) are NOT
# valid here: their terms prohibit "automated scripts, application backends, or
# non-interactive batch processing", which is exactly what this benchmark is.
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=sk-...

# Optional. Omit to run without any credentials:
#   QWEN_MODE=mock   -> simulated agents, zero network, zero spend
